WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.750
A Drawing object

2
00:00:02.274 --> 00:00:05.649
On the Describe screen, add an object. Drawing.

3
00:00:08.068 --> 00:00:10.943
It's called Drawing one. Rename it Drawing.

4
00:00:15.193 --> 00:00:18.068
Place it under the typing box, in Properties.

5
00:00:22.283 --> 00:00:27.158
Each visit should start with a clean page. On start of screen, Clear Drawing.
